 "alt_text": "Two rotation-number maps of the 13-parameter network S2-28011 with the traced curve where its period-2 orbit acquires complex multipliers (69 points). Beyond the curve the rotation number varies continuously and periodic windows appear as constant-color regions; chaotic cells are gray. At 0.002 decades beyond the curve the rotation number matches the crossing angle with median absolute difference 5.8e-04 (39 points, main map) and 3.6e-04 (31 points, right wing). Of the resonance points inside each map, 5 of 7 and 5 of 6 have locked cells of the same rotation nearby.",
